<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
    YEGI domain concepts, version 2.0.

    Three layers, each with one job:

    1. TYPES. rdfs:subClassOf means only "is a kind of" (Maintenance is a
       Process; GrossProfit is a Profit; Port is TransportInfrastructure).
       Entities extracted from documents are typed with these classes.

    2. TOPICS. Concept areas (Financials, Pharmacovigilance, Transportation...)
       are punned owl:Class + skos:Concept, each a direct rdfs:subClassOf
       ConceptArea and nested with skos:broader. They are topics people ask
       about, never types: no concept is a subclass of an area, and no
       entity is typed with one.

    3. MEMBERSHIP. dc:inConceptArea (an owl:AnnotationProperty) links a
       concept's class IRI (the punned skos:Concept) to an area.
       Several areas are allowed (Port is in Transportation and Logistics).
       Being an annotation it adds no OWL class semantics and nothing is
       inferred onto individuals. An extracted entity is in an area only by
       derivation (entity rdf:type C, C or an ancestor inConceptArea A);
       the pipeline never stores entity->area edges, and two entities in
       the same area are NOT related by that fact.

    Terms: skos:altLabel holds true alternative names only (EPS, COGS);
    dc:conceptTerm holds query-routing phrases (broad or ambiguous words
    such as "margin", "equity", "turnover" sit here, never in altLabel).
    Entity retyping reads labels and altLabels, never conceptTerm.

    Deprecated IRIs keep owl:deprecated + dcterms:isReplacedBy; the full
    old-to-new mapping is domain_concepts_migration.json beside this file.

    Namespace: https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#
    Protected via the umbrella https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/ prefix
    (ontology.protected_iri_prefixes).
-->
<rdf:RDF
    xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
    xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
    xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
    xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
    xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
    xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
    xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
    xmlns="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#">

    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts">
        <rdfs:label>Domain Concepts</rdfs:label>
        <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
        <rdfs:comment>YEGI's compact concept layer for finance, pharma, and manufacturing and supply chain. Types (rdfs:subClassOf) anchor newly minted concept classes in the prune-expand pipeline; concept areas (skos, via inConceptArea and skos:broader) route broad questions to the concepts they cover. Each class is dual-typed owl:Class and skos:Concept. Maintained by the curator.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>

    <!-- Annotation properties -->
    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#conceptTerm">
        <rdfs:label>conceptTerm</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">concept term</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>A lowercase phrase that, found in a QUESTION, routes the question to this concept or area and everything under it. Query routing only: not a synonym, and never used to type an entity. Broad or ambiguous words (margin, equity, yield, turnover, earnings) may appear here; true alternative names go in skos:altLabel.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:AnnotationProperty>
    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#inConceptArea">
        <rdfs:label>inConceptArea</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">in concept area</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Topic membership. Subject: a concept, i.e. the class IRI read as its punned skos:Concept. Object: a concept area. Several areas are allowed. An annotation, so it carries no OWL class semantics and nothing is inferred onto individuals; an extracted entity belongs to an area only by derivation (its class, or an ancestor, inConceptArea the area). Sharing an area is not evidence of any relationship between two entities.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:AnnotationProperty>
    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy"/>
    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document">
        <rdfs:comment>Reused from FOAF (always merged); declared here so this file stands alone.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>

    <skos:ConceptScheme rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DomainConceptsScheme">
        <rdfs:label>Domain Concepts Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Domain concepts</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition>The kinds of concept YEGI types entities with: quantities, conditions, processes, agreements, documents and their subclasses.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Quantity"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Condition"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Process"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Method"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Intervention"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Outcome"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PolicyConcept"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#EconomicConcept"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#TechnologyConcept"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Industry"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Infrastructure"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainConcept"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Material"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Event"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#GeographicFeature"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DomainConcept"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Agreement"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#IntellectualProperty"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Plan"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Classification"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#InformationArtifact"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialTable"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialObservation"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Dimension"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#TimePeriod"/>
    </skos:ConceptScheme>

    <skos:ConceptScheme rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme">
        <rdfs:label>Concept Area Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Concept areas</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition>The topics questions are routed through, nested with skos:broader. Concepts join a topic with inConceptArea.</skos:definition>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainManagement"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ESG"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Workforce"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#EnergyMarkets"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#TechnologyAndRnD"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#CorporateEvents"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#GeopoliticalEvents"/>
        <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#LegalAndRegulatoryEvents"/>
    </skos:ConceptScheme>

    <!-- ===== Topic areas ===== -->
    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
        <rdfs:label>ConceptArea</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Concept area</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>A broad subject people ask about. Never a type: no entity is typed with an area and no concept is a subclass of one. Areas nest with skos:broader; concepts join one with inConceptArea.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>A topic that groups concepts for routing questions; not a kind of thing.</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Financials</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financials</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The finance domain: how an organization reports, funds, invests and values itself, and the financial risks it carries.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The finance domain: how an organization reports, funds, invests and values itself, and the financial risks it carries.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: reporting, instruments, financing, working capital, investment, tax, valuation, financial risk, market events. Excludes: operational measures with no money unit (output volume, headcount).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <conceptTerm>financials</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial information</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial data</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial results</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial details</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialReporting">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancialReporting</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial reporting</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What an organization reports about its finances: performance, position, cash flow, the statements themselves, accounting policies and segments.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What an organization reports about its finances: performance, position, cash flow, the statements themselves, accounting policies and segments.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: revenue, profit, assets, cash flow, statements, audit reports, accounting policies, segment results. Excludes: market valuation (Valuation), trading in instruments (FinancialInstruments).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>financial reporting</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial report</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial reports</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialPerformance">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancialPerformance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial performance</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>How much an organization earned and spent over a period.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>How much an organization earned and spent over a period.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: revenue, sales, costs, expenses, profit measures, margins, EPS. Excludes: balances at a point in time (FinancialPosition). 'Turnover', 'earnings' and 'margin' are read here only in a financial context.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialReporting"/>
        <conceptTerm>financial performance</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>profitability</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialPosition">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancialPosition</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial position</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What an organization owns and owes at a point in time.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What an organization owns and owes at a point in time.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: assets, liabilities, equity, cash, debt balance. Excludes: flows over a period (FinancialPerformance, CashFlow).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialReporting"/>
        <conceptTerm>financial position</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>balance sheet position</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#CashFlow">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>CashFlow</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Cash flow</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Money moving into and out of an organization over a period.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Money moving into and out of an organization over a period.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: operating, investing and financing cash flows, capex, dividends paid. Excludes: cash held at a date (Cash, under FinancialPosition).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialReporting"/>
        <conceptTerm>cash flow</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>cash flows</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialInstruments">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancialInstruments</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial instruments</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Contracts that create a financial asset for one party and a liability or equity for another: loans, bonds, shares, derivatives, funds.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Contracts that create a financial asset for one party and a liability or equity for another: loans, bonds, shares, derivatives, funds.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: loans, bonds, debentures, shares, derivatives, funds. Excludes: the amounts reported for them (DebtBalance, Equity).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>financial instruments</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial instrument</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>securities</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancingAndCapitalManagement">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancingAndCapitalManagement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financing and capital management</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>How an organization raises, repays and allocates capital.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>How an organization raises, repays and allocates capital.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: borrowing, debt, share issuance, IPOs, refinancing, capital expenditure, dividends, capital allocation. Excludes: day-to-day working capital.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>capital management</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financing</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>capital structure</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>capital allocation</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#WorkingCapitalManagement">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>WorkingCapitalManagement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Working capital management</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Managing the short-term assets and liabilities that fund daily operations.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Managing the short-term assets and liabilities that fund daily operations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: receivables, payables, inventory value, cash, cash conversion cycle. Excludes: physical stock movements (Inventory, under SupplyChainPlanning).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>working capital</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#InvestmentAndPortfolioManagement">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>InvestmentAndPortfolioManagement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Investment and portfolio management</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Allocating money across investments and tracking their holdings and returns.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Allocating money across investments and tracking their holdings and returns.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: asset allocation, holdings, funds, investment returns, benchmarks. Excludes: an operating company's own capital expenditure.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>investment management</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>portfolio management</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>investment portfolio</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Taxation">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Taxation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Taxation</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Taxes an organization owes, pays or defers.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Taxes an organization owes, pays or defers.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: income tax, effective tax rate, deferred tax. Excludes: tariffs and customs duties (TradeAndCustoms).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>taxation</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>tax</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>taxes</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Valuation">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Valuation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Valuation</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What the market or analysts say an organization is worth.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What the market or analysts say an organization is worth.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: market capitalization, price/earnings ratio, target price. Excludes: book values reported in the statements (FinancialPosition).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>valuation</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#FinancialRisk">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>FinancialRisk</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial risk</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Ways an organization's finances can be harmed.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Ways an organization's finances can be harmed.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: credit, currency, interest-rate and liquidity risk. Excludes: operational supply risk (SupplyChainRiskAndResilience).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>financial risk</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>financial risks</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#MarketEvents">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>MarketEvents</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Market events</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Things that happen in financial markets or in a company's dealings with them.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Things that happen in financial markets or in a company's dealings with them.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: earnings releases and calls, IPOs, price moves. Excludes: mergers and acquisitions (CorporateEvents).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Financials"/>
        <conceptTerm>market events</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>market news</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>PharmaAndLifeSciences</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Pharma and life sciences</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The pharmaceutical domain: developing, testing, approving, making, monitoring and selling medicines.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The pharmaceutical domain: developing, testing, approving, making, monitoring and selling medicines.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: drug development, diseases and indications, modalities, pharmacology, safety, quality, regulatory affairs, market access. Excludes: a pharma company's finances (Financials).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <conceptTerm>pharma</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>pharmaceuticals</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>life sciences</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugDevelopment">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>DrugDevelopment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Drug development</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Taking a medicine from discovery through preclinical and clinical development to its milestones.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Taking a medicine from discovery through preclinical and clinical development to its milestones.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: discovery, preclinical work, clinical trials and their results, development milestones. Excludes: approval decisions (RegulatoryAffairs).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>drug development</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>development pipeline</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug pipeline</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ClinicalEvidence">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ClinicalEvidence</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Clinical evidence</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What trials found about a treatment.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What trials found about a treatment.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: efficacy, response rates, hazard ratios, endpoints. Excludes: the design of the study (ClinicalStudyDesignAndPopulation).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugDevelopment"/>
        <conceptTerm>clinical evidence</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>clinical data</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>clinical results</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>trial results</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ClinicalStudyDesignAndPopulation">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ClinicalStudyDesignAndPopulation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Clinical study design and population</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>How a clinical study is designed and who takes part.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>How a clinical study is designed and who takes part.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: trial phase, study design, comparators, eligibility criteria, cohorts, enrollment. Excludes: what the study found (ClinicalEvidence).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugDevelopment"/>
        <conceptTerm>study design</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>trial design</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>study population</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>trial population</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#TherapeuticAreasAndDiseases">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>TherapeuticAreasAndDiseases</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Therapeutic areas and diseases</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The diseases medicines target and the therapeutic areas they are grouped into.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The diseases medicines target and the therapeutic areas they are grouped into.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: therapeutic areas (oncology, cardiology), diseases, treatment indications. Excludes: harms a medicine causes (DrugSafety).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>therapeutic area</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>therapeutic areas</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>disease area</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>disease areas</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugModalitiesAndComposition">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>DrugModalitiesAndComposition</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Drug modalities and composition</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What a medicine is made of and what kind of medicine it is.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What a medicine is made of and what kind of medicine it is.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: small molecules, biologics, vaccines, cell and gene therapies, active ingredients, excipients, formulations. Excludes: how it acts in the body (Pharmacology).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>drug modality</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug modalities</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug composition</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugProperties">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>DrugProperties</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Drug properties</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What a treatment is, what it treats and how it is given.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What a treatment is, what it treats and how it is given.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: dosage, formulation, indication, mechanism of action, pharmacokinetics. Overlaps the narrower pharma areas on purpose: a question about a drug's profile reaches all of them.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugModalitiesAndComposition"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Pharmacology"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#TherapeuticAreasAndDiseases"/>
        <conceptTerm>drug information</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug properties</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug profile</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Pharmacology">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Pharmacology</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Pharmacology</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>How a medicine acts on the body and how the body handles it.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>How a medicine acts on the body and how the body handles it.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: mechanism of action, drug targets, pharmacokinetics, pharmacodynamics, dosage. Excludes: harms (DrugSafety).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>pharmacology</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Pharmacovigilance">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Pharmacovigilance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Pharmacovigilance</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Monitoring medicines after and during use for harms, and weighing benefit against risk.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Monitoring medicines after and during use for harms, and weighing benefit against risk.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: safety monitoring, safety signals, adverse events and reactions, benefit-risk assessment. Excludes: manufacturing quality defects (PharmaceuticalQualityAndManufacturing).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>pharmacovigilance</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>safety monitoring</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug safety monitoring</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#DrugSafety">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>DrugSafety</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Drug safety</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Harms a treatment can cause and the warnings about them.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Harms a treatment can cause and the warnings about them.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: adverse events, adverse drug reactions, serious adverse events, toxicity, contraindications, boxed warnings. An adverse event is not assumed to be caused by the drug; an adverse drug reaction is.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Pharmacovigilance"/>
        <conceptTerm>drug safety</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>safety data</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>safety profile</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaceuticalQualityAndManufacturing">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>PharmaceuticalQualityAndManufacturing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Pharmaceutical quality and manufacturing</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Making medicines to specification: formulation development, stability, contamination control, batch release.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Making medicines to specification: formulation development, stability, contamination control, batch release.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: formulation development, stability testing, contamination control, batch release. Excludes: general (non-pharma) manufacturing quality (Quality).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Quality"/>
        <conceptTerm>pharmaceutical manufacturing</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>pharmaceutical quality</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>drug manufacturing</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>gmp</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#RegulatoryAffairs">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>RegulatoryAffairs</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Regulatory affairs</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Dealing with regulators: submissions, approvals, labels and the requirements they impose.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Dealing with regulators: submissions, approvals, labels and the requirements they impose.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: regulatory submissions, approvals, drug labels, boxed warnings, post-marketing requirements, regulatory status. Excludes: enforcement events against a company (LegalAndRegulatoryEvents).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>regulatory affairs</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>regulatory pathway</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#RegulatoryStatus">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>RegulatoryStatus</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Regulatory status</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Where a product stands with its regulators.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Where a product stands with its regulators.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: approval status, pending submissions. A narrower view of RegulatoryAffairs.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#RegulatoryAffairs"/>
        <conceptTerm>regulatory status</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>regulatory approval status</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>approval status</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#MarketAccess">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>MarketAccess</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Market access</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Whether and at what price a product reaches its buyers.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Whether and at what price a product reaches its buyers.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: pricing, list prices, reimbursement, payer coverage. Excludes: the revenue it earns (FinancialPerformance).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PharmaAndLifeSciences"/>
        <conceptTerm>market access</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ManufacturingOperations</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Manufacturing operations</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The manufacturing domain: planning, running, costing and maintaining production.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The manufacturing domain: planning, running, costing and maintaining production.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: production planning, performance, processes, materials, costs, quality, equipment and maintenance, plant safety. Excludes: moving goods between sites (SupplyChainManagement).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing operations</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production operations</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ProductionPlanningAndControl">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ProductionPlanningAndControl</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Production planning and control</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Deciding what to make, when and with what capacity, and tracking it on the floor.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Deciding what to make, when and with what capacity, and tracking it on the floor.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: scheduling, production orders, work in progress, capacity planning. Excludes: demand forecasting (SupplyChainPlanning).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>production planning</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production control</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production schedule</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ProductionPerformance">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ProductionPerformance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Production performance</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>How much a plant produces and how efficiently.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>How much a plant produces and how efficiently.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: capacity, output, yield, throughput, utilization. Excludes: money measures (ManufacturingCosts).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>production performance</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing performance</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production data</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingProcesses">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ManufacturingProcesses</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Manufacturing processes</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The kinds of process that turn inputs into products.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The kinds of process that turn inputs into products.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: assembly, machining, molding, fermentation, packaging. Excludes: the equipment that runs them (AssetAndMaintenanceManagement).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing process</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing processes</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production process</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#MaterialsAndProductStructure">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>MaterialsAndProductStructure</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Materials and product structure</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What products are made from and how they are built up.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What products are made from and how they are built up.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: raw materials, components, intermediates, finished goods, bills of materials, scrap material. Excludes: buying them (Sourcing).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>product structure</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>materials management</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingCosts">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>ManufacturingCosts</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Manufacturing costs</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>What it costs to make a product.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>What it costs to make a product.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: cost of goods sold, unit, labour and energy cost. Excludes: company-wide operating expenses (FinancialPerformance).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing cost</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing costs</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production cost</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>production costs</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Quality">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Quality</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Quality</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Whether products meet their requirements.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Whether products meet their requirements.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: defect and scrap rates, inspections, nonconformances, recalls, certifications. Excludes: a plant's safety record (PlantSafetyAndCompliance).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>product quality</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>quality data</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>quality issues</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#AssetAndMaintenanceManagement">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>AssetAndMaintenanceManagement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Asset and maintenance management</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Keeping production equipment working over its life: maintenance, reliability, failures.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Keeping production equipment working over its life: maintenance, reliability, failures.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: equipment, maintenance, reliability, failures, downtime, equipment lifecycle. Excludes: financial assets (FinancialPosition).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>asset management</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>maintenance management</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>equipment maintenance</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Equipment">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Equipment</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Equipment</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The machinery production depends on and how it performs.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The machinery production depends on and how it performs.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A topic, not a type: Maintenance belongs here as a topic but is a Process, not a kind of equipment. The type of the machinery itself is ProductionEquipment.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#AssetAndMaintenanceManagement"/>
        <conceptTerm>manufacturing equipment</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>plant equipment</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#PlantSafetyAndCompliance">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>PlantSafetyAndCompliance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Plant safety and compliance</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Keeping people and the environment safe around production.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Keeping people and the environment safe around production.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: incident rates, safety standards, environmental permits.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ManufacturingOperations"/>
        <conceptTerm>plant safety</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>workplace safety</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainManagement">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>SupplyChainManagement</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Supply chain management</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>The supply-chain domain: sourcing, planning, moving, storing and tracing goods, and keeping supply resilient.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>The supply-chain domain: sourcing, planning, moving, storing and tracing goods, and keeping supply resilient.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: sourcing, planning, logistics, transportation, warehousing, trade and customs, traceability, risk and resilience. Excludes: what happens inside a plant (ManufacturingOperations).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <conceptTerm>supply chain</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>supply chains</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>supply chain management</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Sourcing">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Sourcing</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sourcing</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Where inputs come from and how they are bought.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Where inputs come from and how they are bought.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: procurement, suppliers, supply contracts, single and sole sourcing. Excludes: moving the goods (Logistics).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainManagement"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainRiskAndResilience"/>
        <conceptTerm>sourcing</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>supply base</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainPlanning">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>SupplyChainPlanning</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Supply chain planning</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:comment>Balancing demand and supply ahead of time: forecasting, supply planning, replenishment, S&amp;OP.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:definition>Balancing demand and supply ahead of time: forecasting, supply planning, replenishment, S&amp;OP.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Includes: demand and supply planning, replenishment, sales and operations planning, inventory. Excludes: the production schedule inside a plant (ProductionPlanningAndControl).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptAreaScheme"/>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#SupplyChainManagement"/>
        <conceptTerm>supply chain planning</conceptTerm>
        <conceptTerm>supply planning</conceptTerm>
    </owl:Class>

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#Demand">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://veerla-ramrao.ai/ontology/domain-concepts#ConceptArea"/>
        <rdfs:label>Demand</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Demand</skos:prefLabel>
