        <rdfs:comment>The subject has, suffers or is in this kind of condition. 'patient cohort hasCondition type 2 diabetes'; 'company hasCondition liquidity risk'.</rdfs:comment>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Links an entity to a concept DESCRIPTOR (a kind of quantity, condition, process...), never to a value. Numerical facts are FinancialObservation individuals from the table pipeline, each with its entity, concept, period, unit and source.</skos:scopeNote>
